//　ホームの端へ。

//　そこから線路に躍る。
  I drop my bags and take off running, paying no heed to the angry shouts as I barrel through the crowd. The world is a white darkness, empty but for the train.

  The platform ends. I jump onto the tracks.

pt:
//　荷物を放り捨てて走り出す。
